---

---

<section id="how-to-enable" class="how-to-enable">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">強制カラーモードの有効化手順</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">
      このデモはOSレベルで強制カラーモードを有効にするか、Chrome DevTools
      でエミュレートして確認します。
    </p>

    <div class="how-to-enable__grid">
      <!-- Windows -->
      <div class="how-to-enable__card how-to-enable__card--recommended">
        <div class="how-to-enable__card-header">
          <span class="how-to-enable__platform-icon" aria-hidden="true">🪟</span
          >
          <h3 class="how-to-enable__platform-title">Windows</h3>
          <!-- <span class="how-to-enable__badge how-to-enable__badge--recommended"
            >推奨</span
          > -->
        </div>
        <ol class="how-to-enable__steps">
          <li>設定 → アクセシビリティ → コントラストテーマ</li>
          <li>スタイルのいずれかを選択</li>
          <li>「適用」ボタンをクリック</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="how-to-enable__shortcut">
          ショートカット: <kbd>Alt</kbd> + <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd
            >PrintScreen</kbd
          >
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Chrome DevTools -->
      <div class="how-to-enable__card">
        <div class="how-to-enable__card-header">
          <span class="how-to-enable__platform-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔧</span
          >
          <h3 class="how-to-enable__platform-title">Chrome DevTools</h3>
        </div>
        <ol class="how-to-enable__steps">
          <li><kbd>⌘</kbd> + <kbd>⌥</kbd> + <kbd>I</kbd> で DevTools を開く</li>
          <li>
            <kbd>⌘</kbd> + <kbd>⌥</kbd> + <kbd>P</kbd> で<b
              >Emulate CSS media feature forced-colors</b
            >または<b>CSS forced-colorsをエミュレートする</b>を実行する
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p class="how-to-enable__note">
          ページリロードなしで即座に切り替わります
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- macOS -->
      <div class="how-to-enable__card how-to-enable__card--not-recommended">
        <div class="how-to-enable__card-header">
          <span class="how-to-enable__platform-icon" aria-hidden="true">🍎</span
          >
          <h3 class="how-to-enable__platform-title">macOS</h3>
          <!-- <span class="how-to-enable__badge how-to-enable__badge--warning"
            >非推奨</span
          > -->
        </div>
        <p class="how-to-enable__description">
          macOS の「コントラストを上げる」はアクセシビリティ設定にありますが、
          <code>forced-colors</code> メディアクエリには対応していません。
        </p>
        <p class="how-to-enable__note">
          → Chrome DevTools のエミュレーションをご利用ください
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .how-to-enable {
    padding: $space-3xl 0;

    .section-title {
      font-size: $font-size-2xl;
      margin-bottom: $space-sm;
    }

    .section-lead {
      color: $color-text-muted;
      margin-bottom: $space-xl;
    }
  }

  .how-to-enable__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: $space-md;
  }

  .how-to-enable__card {
    @include card;
    position: relative;
  }

  .how-to-enable__card--recommended {
    border-color: $color-primary;
    border-width: 2px;
  }

  .how-to-enable__card--not-recommended {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  @media (forced-colors: active) {
    .how-to-enable__card {
      border: 1px solid ButtonText;
    }

    .how-to-enable__card--recommended {
      border: 2px solid Highlight;
    }
  }

  .how-to-enable__card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: $space-sm;
    margin-bottom: $space-md;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .how-to-enable__platform-icon {
    font-size: $font-size-xl;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .how-to-enable__platform-title {
    font-size: $font-size-lg;
    font-weight: $font-weight-semibold;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .how-to-enable__badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px $space-sm;
    border-radius: $border-radius-full;
    font-size: $font-size-xs;
    font-weight: $font-weight-semibold;
  }

  .how-to-enable__badge--recommended {
    background-color: $color-badge-good-bg;
    color: $color-badge-good-text;
  }

  .how-to-enable__badge--warning {
    background-color: $color-surface-alt;
    color: $color-text-muted;
  }

  @media (forced-colors: active) {
    .how-to-enable__badge {
      border: 1px solid ButtonText;
      background-color: Canvas;
      color: CanvasText;
    }
  }

  .how-to-enable__steps {
    list-style: decimal;
    padding-left: $space-lg;
    margin-bottom: $space-md;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: $space-xs;

    li {
      font-size: $font-size-sm;
      line-height: $line-height-base;
    }
  }

  .how-to-enable__shortcut {
    font-size: $font-size-sm;
    color: $color-text-muted;
    margin-top: $space-sm;
  }

  .how-to-enable__description {
    font-size: $font-size-sm;
    line-height: $line-height-base;
    color: $color-text-muted;
    margin-bottom: $space-sm;
  }

  .how-to-enable__note {
    font-size: $font-size-sm;
    color: $color-text-muted;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  kbd {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    font-family: $font-family-mono;
    font-size: $font-size-xs;
    color: $color-text;
    background-color: $color-surface-alt;
    border: 1px solid $color-border-dark;
    border-radius: $border-radius-sm;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 $color-border-dark;

    @media (forced-colors: active) {
      background-color: ButtonFace;
      color: ButtonText;
      border: 1px solid ButtonText;
      box-shadow: none;
    }
  }

  code {
    font-family: $font-family-mono;
    font-size: $font-size-xs;
    background-color: $color-surface-alt;
    padding: 1px $space-xs;
    border-radius: $border-radius-sm;
    border: 1px solid $color-border;

    @media (forced-colors: active) {
      background-color: Canvas;
      color: CanvasText;
      border: 1px solid ButtonText;
    }
  }
</style>
